  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'It seems that this bouquet was caught in the branches of the tree. Is
      it yours ? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: Rather, it is the last tribute I paid to my daughter. These were her favorite
      flowers and the rare ones that grew in this region.
  - speaker: 1
    text: My wife and I spent days and nights making this bouquet for her...
